# Guest RFQ quote (locked spec)

If `rfqBuyerKind` is **guest**, do **not** submit / update a quote to Mattex Marketplace (no My RFQs account).

- Disable **Submit To Buyer** / **Update quote to buyer**.
- `quoteRfqToBuyer` must return `{ error: "guest" }` and not mark the RFQ as sent to MM.
- Guest delivery path is **Send quote on WhatsApp** (freeze public `/zh/quote/:token`, then sales clicks **Quote sent on WhatsApp**). That sets `quoteDelivery: "whatsapp"` only — never `reviewStatus: quoted`.
- Handling: **Assign to registered member** (searchable name / email / company) then submit, **or WhatsApp / PDF**. Assign still works after a WhatsApp send. **Create TMS iRFQ** stays available.

```jsx
// ❌ BAD
<button onClick={() => quoteRfqToBuyer(guestRfq.id)}>Submit To Buyer</button>

// ✅ GOOD
<button disabled={rfqBuyerKind(rfq) !== "member"} title="Guest has no marketplace account. Assign a member, or WhatsApp the quote.">
  Submit To Buyer
</button>
<button onClick={openWhatsAppQuote}>Send quote on WhatsApp</button>
```
